fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"closedcaption/GstCodecCCInserter.html#GstCodecCCInserter:caption-meta-order","fragment":"\n\tcaption-meta-order\n\nOrder of caption metas attached on buffers. In case of \"display\" order, inserter will reorder captions to decoding order\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tdecode (0)\n\n"});